   "text": "FRED and multpl provide LATEST REVISED vintages, not as-first-published real-time values. Historical percentiles therefore carry a small, unavoidable revision look-ahead."
  },
  {
   "level": "CAVEAT",
   "text": "CAPE, earnings yield and P/E carry a conservative 95-day publication lag; the value knowable today is months old by design. This is disclosed rather than filled with a fresher guess."
