  {
   "level": "CAVEAT",
   "text": "HY OAS begins 2023-11-20, so long-history credit stress falls back to a disclosed HYG/LQD price proxy. The TED-like funding signal is a proxy: literal LIBOR TED ended in 2021."
  },
  {
   "level": "CAVEAT",
   "text": "McClellan, put/call, advance/decline and % above 200DMA are price-based proxies built from ETFs. They are NOT exchange breadth or options tape."
